<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@/~part_IV__cl_9__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Notis itu hendaklah termasuk perihalan ringkas mengenai maklumat sensitif itu."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@/~part_IV__cl_9__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@/~part_IV__cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@> .
