<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_29__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "ditahan di bawah mana-mana undang-undang bertulis lain; atau"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_29__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_29> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@> .
