<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@/~part_VII__cl_26> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "26" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@/~part_VII__cl_26> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@/~part_VII__cl_26__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@/~part_VII__cl_26__subsec_1__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@/~part_VII__cl_26__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@/~part_VII__cl_26__subsec_1__para_b> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/15/msa@> .
